== (0) reflection is exhausted ==
  an RP-form sample engineered to break word positivity: min p(w) over |w| <= 10 = -4.638e-03  (INVALID process)
  yet its reflected Gram (24 words, |w| <= 4) has eig_min = -1.8e-17 >= 0: PSD
  -> within the RP-form, EVERY reflected Gram is a Gram of
     vectors B_w Omega (B_rev(w) = B_w^dagger): automatically
     PSD.  Reflection positivity is EXHAUSTED by the form;
     the entire remaining content of (PR-RP+) is WORD
     POSITIVITY of the non-commutative form.

